{
  "displayName": "tx-agent-kit - Resource Usage",
  "description": "Per-container and host (VM) CPU/RAM usage from the docker_stats + hostmetrics receivers. Container series are grouped by container_name; host series describe the VM the containers run inside. Filter by deployment_environment_name to scope to staging or prod. NOTE: GMP-rendered metric names are confirmed post-deploy via `gcloud monitoring metrics list` and PromQL here may need a unit-suffix tweak.",
  "labels": {
    "component": "resource-usage"
  },
  "mosaicLayout": {
    "columns": 48,
    "tiles": [
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 0,
        "width": 48,
        "height": 4,
        "widget": {
          "text": {
            "content": "## Resource Usage Dashboard\n\nPer-container CPU/RAM (from the `docker_stats` receiver) and host CPU/RAM/load/filesystem (from the `hostmetrics` receiver).\n\n**Host metrics reflect the host VM**, i.e. the resource envelope the containers run inside - NOT the physical host. On GCP the same series describe the GCE node.\n\nUsage-only: there are no memory limits enforced; this is observability to size and right-size services.\n\nSet the `deployment_environment_name` filter above to the staging or prod environment. PromQL metric names below assume the standard GMP rendering (OTel dots -> underscores, `By` unit -> `_bytes` suffix); confirm exact names post-deploy with `gcloud monitoring metrics list`.",
            "format": "MARKDOWN"
          },
          "title": "Dashboard Info"
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 4,
        "width": 48,
        "height": 2,
        "widget": {
          "collapsibleGroup": {
            "collapsed": false
          },
          "title": "Containers"
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 6,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 8,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Container CPU Utilization (%) by container_name",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "targetAxis": "Y1",
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "prometheusQuery": "max(container_cpu_utilization_ratio) by (container_name)"
                }
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "CPU %",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            },
            "chartOptions": {
              "mode": "COLOR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 24,
        "yPos": 6,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 8,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Container Memory Utilization (% of VM) by container_name",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "targetAxis": "Y1",
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "prometheusQuery": "max(container_memory_percent_ratio) by (container_name)"
                }
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "memory %",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            },
            "chartOptions": {
              "mode": "COLOR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 22,
        "width": 48,
        "height": 2,
        "widget": {
          "collapsibleGroup": {
            "collapsed": false
          },
          "title": "Host (VM)"
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 24,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 8,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Host CPU Utilization (ratio 0-1)",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "targetAxis": "Y1",
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "prometheusQuery": "1 - avg(system_cpu_utilization_ratio{state=\"idle\"})"
                }
              }
            ],
            "thresholds": [
              {
                "label": "warn 0.9",
                "value": 0.9,
                "targetAxis": "Y1"
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "ratio",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            },
            "chartOptions": {
              "mode": "COLOR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 24,
        "yPos": 24,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 8,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Host Memory Utilization (ratio 0-1)",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "targetAxis": "Y1",
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "prometheusQuery": "max(system_memory_utilization_ratio{state=\"used\"})"
                }
              }
            ],
            "thresholds": [
              {
                "label": "warn 0.85",
                "value": 0.85,
                "targetAxis": "Y1"
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "ratio",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            },
            "chartOptions": {
              "mode": "COLOR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 32,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 8,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Host Memory Usage (bytes) by state",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "plotType": "STACKED_AREA",
                "targetAxis": "Y1",
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "prometheusQuery": "sum(system_memory_usage_bytes) by (state)"
                }
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "bytes",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            },
            "chartOptions": {
              "mode": "COLOR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 24,
        "yPos": 32,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 8,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Host Load Average (1m)",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "targetAxis": "Y1",
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "prometheusQuery": "avg(system_cpu_load_average_1m)"
                }
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "load",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            },
            "chartOptions": {
              "mode": "COLOR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 40,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 8,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Host Filesystem Utilization (ratio 0-1) by mountpoint",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "targetAxis": "Y1",
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "prometheusQuery": "max(system_filesystem_utilization_ratio) by (mountpoint)"
                }
              }
            ],
            "thresholds": [
              {
                "label": "warn 0.85",
                "value": 0.85,
                "targetAxis": "Y1"
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "ratio",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            },
            "chartOptions": {
              "mode": "COLOR"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
